---
import { GITHUB_URL, SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`${SITE_TITLE} 소개`}>
  <article class="prose ue-prose max-w-none">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      안녕하세요, <strong>{SITE_TITLE}</strong>입니다. 개발하면서 배운 것들과 생각을 정리해 두는
      개인 블로그입니다.
    </p>

    <h2>기술 스택</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Framework:</strong> Astro</li>
      <li><strong>Styling:</strong> Tailwind CSS + daisyUI</li>
      <li><strong>Hosting:</strong> GitHub Pages</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>연락처</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
